WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:19.580
Rain bearing no secrets,

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:22.130
Falling from a sky without answers.

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:26.300
It’s like an old folktale—a 
story coming to life.

00:00:26.950 --> 00:00:28.300
At the time,

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.000
I didn’t know where I belonged.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.920
I merely floated by with a hopeless smile.

00:00:34.750 --> 00:00:38.880
On the day that I promised 
I’d never turn back

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.020
I recall it all like yesterday,

00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:43.020
when the walls began to crack

00:00:43.020 --> 00:00:45.020
Ever all resolved to just falling,

00:00:45.020 --> 00:00:47.300
near gave up along the way

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:49.600
I will protect that smile

00:00:49.910 --> 00:00:51.550
That’s piercing towards the clear blue sky.

00:00:51.660 --> 00:00:56.050
I don’t know if I’ll 
be of any use to you.

00:00:56.250 --> 00:00:58.090
I’m not really the main character type,

00:00:58.090 --> 00:01:00.430
But by your side is where 
I’ll be (standing with you).

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.290
I want to sing,

00:01:02.290 --> 00:01:04.260
If only solely on bravery.

00:01:04.260 --> 00:01:06.540
Can you hear that promise ringing out?

00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:08.570
‘cause I just won’t let it die

00:01:08.660 --> 00:01:12.910
I don’t know what sort of 
future is waiting for us.

00:01:12.910 --> 00:01:14.750
I know there’ll be some 
difficult times ahead,

00:01:14.750 --> 00:01:17.420
But even so, I still believe 
(fight by your side)

00:01:17.420 --> 00:01:19.310
Even if I’ve only got half the courage

00:01:19.310 --> 00:01:21.450
I want to push forward.

00:01:21.450 --> 00:01:24.620
I’m certain I’ll never leave your side.

00:01:25.220 --> 00:01:29.420
I’ll be there.

